  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Musikavanhu B Horticulture production and marketing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assistance will improve the management capacity to direct and control operations at MB through strengthening internal controls and establishing a business plan, policies and procedures. Farmers will be assisted with inputs. Assistance will also provide training in post-harvest handling and storage, enterprise planning, and corporate governance, agronomy and use of good agricultural systems and standards and financial literacy.</narrative>
  </description>
